'''Jillsarians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with four [[Limb|arms]]<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> that [[Homeworld|hailed]] from the [[Jillsaria system]]<ref name="Planetnamia" /> in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Appendix">{{GalaxyMapAppendix}}</ref> [[Doctor]] [[Quadpaw]], who otherwise kept his name a secret,<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|doctor-quadpaw|Doctor Quadpaw}}</ref> was a male<ref name="The Eye Audio">{{Andor|The Eye}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref> Jillsarian who lived during the [[Imperial Era]] and found work as a for-hire physician. Beyond his four dexterous arms, Quadpaw made use of [[cybernetic]]-enhancements, which enhanced his [[eye]]s and [[ear]]s; together, his enhancements and Jillsarian biology allowed him to carry out precise, if expensive, work<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> as a surgeon<ref name="Databank" /> on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]]<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> [[moon]]<ref name="The Eye Audio" /> [[Frezno]] in an unassuming tent.<ref name="Encyclopedia" />

